\newlabel{tab:rq2-tiers}{{9}{32}{RQ2 expressibility classification of the 34 annotation-model limitation cases (L4--L5). \emph {Inexpressible}: no annotation yields a non-\textit {Satisfied} verdict even with full bug awareness. \emph {Strong}: the annotation encodes the correct value directly. \emph {Weak}: the annotation provides an awareness signal (change detection) without encoding the correct value}{table.caption.24}{}}
